# USDA FoodData Central API key — free, from https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
# Falls back to DEMO_KEY, which allows only 30 requests/hour. Search resolves one
# request per result row, so DEMO_KEY runs out after ~6 searches.
FDC_API_KEY=

# Same key, exposed to the Expo runtime. Not used until the search screen lands.
# Note: EXPO_PUBLIC_* is bundled into the client and is readable by anyone with
# the app. Acceptable for a rate-limited read-only key; revisit if we ever proxy.
EXPO_PUBLIC_FDC_API_KEY=
